{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39152","headline":"早秋夜作 · 韦庄","name":"早秋夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠簟初清暑半销，[撇]帘松韵送轻飙。\n莎庭露永琴书润，山郭月明砧杵遥。\n傍砌绿苔鸣蟋蟀，遶檐红树织蠨蛸。\n不须更作悲秋赋，王粲辞家鬓已凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}